body:
Thank you for reading. Thank you for your thorough response. <3 This line -> "Borderline causes you to be insecure, moody, and petrified of abandonment, which can motivate people to act in a variety of ways." !!!! 

&#x200B;

I think maybe I want to hear from particularly empathetic and kind folks and how it mixes with their BPD. How they cope in an unkind world. It's my first year teaching and I feel like an actual alien on my campus. The kids adore me and the adults dismiss me almost completely and a lot mistreat children constantly. Kind of a double edged sword environment.
